    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialized handler for PointCloud2 topics (e.g. raw LiDAR) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Processing pipeline:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Temporal downsampling — skip N frames (reuses Downsampler&lt;T&gt;)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Radius crop — discard points beyond max_radius</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Voxel grid filtering — PCL VoxelGrid to reduce spatial density</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Field stripping — keep only xyz (+ optional intensity)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Protobuf conversion — pack as foxglove.PointCloud for native rendering</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>This prevents a single point-cloud panel in Foxglove from saturating the WebSocket link and starving other panels (camera, odometry, …). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
